DB-IP "IP to Country Lite" database
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
IP Geolocation by DB-IP (https://db-ip.com)

The swarmy-dns image (apps/dns/Dockerfile) and the controller image
(apps/api/Dockerfile) download and bundle the DB-IP "IP to Country Lite"
database, unmodified, licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International License (CC BY 4.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Each image also writes this
attribution, with the bundled edition, to a NOTICE file next to the database.
The dashboard's Geo-DNS steering section shows the attribution too.
MaxMind GeoLite2 is never bundled; operators supply their own licence key.

